      "comment": "REDEEMER'S WAY (7) has been in super consistent form recently with five minors on end before breaking through for an overdue win (16.51) at Q Straight. Goes very well from this box. Drawn wide but with a clean break will be tough to beat again. NEON DRIFT (1) is looking to continue her winning ways off a brilliant 19.49 victory at this track. Bold showing expected again. MEGA MOVE (6) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (19.70) at this track behind Unstable Mable in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Must be included in calculations. MR. O'MALLEY (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
